Original formalization and references
-------------------------------------

Rhombus_HOL_Syntax.thy, Rhombus_HOL_Substitution.thy,
Rhombus_HOL_Semantics.thy, Rhombus_HOL_Soundness.thy,
Rhombus_HOL_Extensions.thy, Rhombus_HOL_Base_Model.thy,
Rhombus_HOL_Adequacy.thy, Rhombus_HOL_Countermodels.thy,
Rhombus_HOL_Audit.thy, Rhombus_HOL_Code_API.thy, and Rhombus_HOL_Code.thy are
original 0BSD formalization, proofs, diagnostics, and export configuration.
Importing Isabelle/HOL, HOL-ZF, or Nitpick does not copy their source into these
files.

HOL4 src/bool/boolScript.sml, audited at commit
6431d43f7bf14b15ea90d5dc99f18145d1a59944, supplies the published choice of
ETA_AX, SELECT_AX, and BOOL_CASES_AX used by the target logic. No HOL4 source
expression was found in this formalization, so THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/HOL4.txt is
retained as an exact provenance record and BSD-3-Clause is not applied to the
theory files.

